"entity": {
"name": "BNP Paribas Bank Polska Spolka Akcyjna",
"description": "BNP Paribas Bank Polska SA engages in the provision of commercial banking services. It operates through the following segments: Retail and Business Banking, Banking of Small and Medium-Sized Enterprises (SME), Corporate Banking, Corporate and Institutional Banking (CIB), and Other Operations. The Retail and Business Banking segment offers services to retail customers, including private banking customers as well as business clients. The SME Banking segment provides services to farmers, and agro and non-agro clients. The Corporate Banking segment focuses on financial services provided to large and medium-sized companies. The CIB segment supports sales of the group's products dedicated to the largest Polish enterprises and provides services to strategic clients. The Other Banking Operations segment consists of the Asset and Liability Management Division and Corporate Centre. The company was founded in 1822 and is headquartered in Warsaw, Poland.",
